cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Mouse Tumor Segmentation with Detectron2"
abstract: >-
  Automated instance segmentation of subcutaneous mouse tumors using
  Detectron2 (Mask R-CNN). Trains RGB, Depth, and RGD (Red-Green-Depth)
  model variants on data from Biopticon's TI-2 structured-light scanner.
type: software
